  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g499646-d1500379-r1032005085-Gidgee_Inn_Motel-Cloncurry_Queensland.html",
  "title": "Nicest accom’s in the Curry",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "The bathroom alone is bigger than a donga.\nI see the restaurant has changed a bit, used to be very expensive, now seems there’s fewer options but much more reasonable prices for meals. Heaps of (undercover) parking that’ll fit a mine site compliant LV ie. ROPs and lights/beacon plus the overflow for trailers etc.\nLads said the pool needs a clean and a chlorine bomb. Traffic noise was a lot louder than I expected but room was nice and dark and WiFi worked (though I couldn’t find password details anywhere in my room).\nGetting pedantic here but access to the powerpoints in the microwave recess was annoying. 3 bottles of water in the fridge, heaps of milks, instant coffee, sugars, biscuits etc were very welcome",
  "username": "chrisbB9612TG",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
